        "91f198b5-971d-41fd-b8aa-b1522e3f22de": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 560,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Publishes a real post\n\nThis flow **publishes** a post to the **first channel** of the connected Buffer account (Share Now). Connect a Buffer account whose first channel is a test social profile. Delete Post removes the post from Buffer only, not from the social network.\n\nThe trigger polls the first organization every 5 minutes, so the run takes up to ~7 minutes. Run it alone: another post published in the organization meanwhile fails the assertion."
        }
